 #: src/glossary/glossary.xml:1129(para)
 msgid ""
 "Editing high dynamic range data requires that there isn't any clamping code "
 "in editing operations and blend modes. At floating point precision:"
 msgstr ""
+"Redigering av data med stort dynamiskt omfång kräver att redigeringsåtgärder"
+" och blandningslägen inte begränsar värdena. Vid flyttalsprecision:"
 
 #: src/glossary/glossary.xml:1133(para)
 msgid ""
 "Many (but not all) GIMP blend modes are unclamped, including Normal, "
-"Addition, Subtract, Multiply, Lighten Only, Darken Only, Difference, and the "
-"LCH and Luminance blend modes. Blend modes such as Screen, Soft Light, and "
+"Addition, Subtract, Multiply, Lighten Only, Darken Only, Difference, and the"
+" LCH and Luminance blend modes. Blend modes such as Screen, Soft Light, and "
 "Overlay are not unclamped as these operations are designed to work with "
 "display-referred data."
 msgstr ""
+"Många, men inte alla, blandningslägen i GIMP begränsar inte värdena till ett"
+" visst intervall. Det gäller bland annat Normal, Addition, Subtraktion, "
+"Multiplicera, Ljusare endast, Mörkare endast, Skillnad samt LCH- och "
+"luminanslägena. Lägen som Skärm, Mjukt ljus och Överlagring begränsar "
+"däremot värdena, eftersom de är avsedda för visningsrelaterade data."
 
 #: src/glossary/glossary.xml:1139(para)
 msgid ""
-"Many (too many to list but certainly not all, as some editing operations are "
-"designed to work with display-referred data) GIMP editing operations also "
+"Many (too many to list but certainly not all, as some editing operations are"
+" designed to work with display-referred data) GIMP editing operations also "
 "are unclamped, including Levels, Exposure, transforms such as scaling and "
 "rotating, and various filter operations such as Gaussian blur."
 msgstr ""
+"Många redigeringsåtgärder i GIMP begränsar inte heller värdena, även om "
+"vissa gör det eftersom de är avsedda för visningsrelaterade data. Bland de "
+"obeskurna åtgärderna finns Nivåer, Exponering, omformningar som skalning och"
+" rotation samt filter som Gaussisk oskärpa."
 
