 #: src/glossary/glossary.xml:1205(para)
 msgid ""
@@ -1406,40 +2018,58 @@
 "doesn't easily describe how we read them in everyday life: a light green, "
 "pale pink, dazzling red, etc. HSV and HSL models allow direct access to "
 "these characteristics while also maintaining a quick and easy internal "
-"conversion to (and the same overall <link linkend=\"glossary-gamut\">gamut</"
-"link> as) the RGB values used to display the image: notice that when you "
-"change a color in HSV or HSL terms, the RGB values also change to match."
-msgstr ""
+"conversion to (and the same overall <link linkend=\"glossary-"
+"gamut\">gamut</link> as) the RGB values used to display the image: notice "
+"that when you change a color in HSV or HSL terms, the RGB values also change"
+" to match."
+msgstr ""
+"RGB-modellen är utformad för att visa färger på en skärm, men beskriver inte"
